<!--
    Everything the user can configure.

    <properties> are the stored values and their defaults.
    <settings>   describes the screen shown in Garmin Connect / Connect IQ on the phone
                 (only available when the face is installed through the Connect IQ Store).
    The same options are also offered in an on-watch menu - see source/Settings.mc.

    Colours are stored as an index into the display's 8 colour palette:
    0 Black, 1 White, 2 Red, 3 Yellow, 4 Green, 5 Cyan, 6 Blue, 7 Magenta
-->
